{
  "script_id": "quadratic-function",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.69,
      "size": 43056,
      "text": "欢迎来到二次函数实验！今天我们要学习一种非常重要的函数——二次函数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.05,
      "size": 48816,
      "text": "二次函数的图像是一条优美的曲线，叫做抛物线。它在物理和工程中有广泛应用。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.21,
      "size": 35280,
      "text": "比如投篮时篮球的运动轨迹、喷泉的水流形状，都是抛物线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "formula",
      "line_id": "formula-1",
      "filename": "formula-formula-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/formula-formula-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.77,
      "size": 44352,
      "text": "二次函数的一般形式是 y 等于 ax 平方加 bx 加 c，其中 a 不等于 0。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "formula",
      "line_id": "formula-2",
      "filename": "formula-formula-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/formula-formula-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.95,
      "size": 31248,
      "text": "a 是二次项系数，它决定了抛物线的开口方向和宽窄。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "formula",
      "line_id": "formula-3",
      "filename": "formula-formula-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/formula-formula-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.28,
      "size": 36432,
      "text": "b 是一次项系数，c 是常数项，它们共同决定了抛物线的位置。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "formula",
      "line_id": "formula-4",
      "filename": "formula-formula-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/formula-formula-4.mp3",
      "duration": 3.48,
      "size": 55728,
      "text": "除了一般式，还有顶点式 y = a(x-h)² + k，其中 (h, k) 是顶点坐标。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "coefficient-a",
      "line_id": "coefficient-a-1",
      "filename": "coefficient-a-coefficient-a-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/coefficient-a-coefficient-a-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.31,
      "size": 37008,
      "text": "系数 a 是二次函数中最重要的参数，它决定了抛物线的基本形态。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "coefficient-a",
      "line_id": "coefficient-a-2",
      "filename": "coefficient-a-coefficient-a-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/coefficient-a-coefficient-a-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.12,
      "size": 33984,
      "text": "当 a 大于 0 时，抛物线开口向上，像一个碗，有最低点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "coefficient-a",
      "line_id": "coefficient-a-3",
      "filename": "coefficient-a-coefficient-a-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/coefficient-a-coefficient-a-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.18,
      "size": 34848,
      "text": "当 a 小于 0 时，抛物线开口向下，像一座山，有最高点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "coefficient-a",
      "line_id": "coefficient-a-4",
      "filename": "coefficient-a-coefficient-a-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/coefficient-a-coefficient-a-4.mp3",
      "duration": 2.61,
      "size": 41760,
      "text": "a 的绝对值越大，抛物线越窄越陡；绝对值越小，抛物线越宽越平缓。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "coefficient-a",
      "line_id": "coefficient-a-5",
      "filename": "coefficient-a-coefficient-a-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/coefficient-a-coefficient-a-5.mp3",
      "duration": 1.57,
      "size": 25200,
      "text": "试着调整 a 的值，观察抛物线如何变化。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "vertex",
      "line_id": "vertex-1",
      "filename": "vertex-vertex-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/vertex-vertex-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.37,
      "size": 37872,
      "text": "抛物线有一个特殊的点叫做顶点，它是抛物线的最高点或最低点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "vertex",
      "line_id": "vertex-2",
      "filename": "vertex-vertex-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/vertex-vertex-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.62,
      "size": 41904,
      "text": "顶点的横坐标公式是 x = -b/(2a)，纵坐标可以代入函数求得。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "vertex",
      "line_id": "vertex-3",
      "filename": "vertex-vertex-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/vertex-vertex-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.55,
      "size": 40752,
      "text": "过顶点且垂直于 x 轴的直线叫做对称轴，抛物线关于它左右对称。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "vertex",
      "line_id": "vertex-4",
      "filename": "vertex-vertex-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/vertex-vertex-4.mp3",
      "duration": 1.86,
      "size": 29808,
      "text": "图中红色的点就是顶点，灰色虚线就是对称轴。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "roots",
      "line_id": "roots-1",
      "filename": "roots-roots-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/roots-roots-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.51,
      "size": 56160,
      "text": "抛物线与 x 轴的交点叫做函数的根或零点，也就是方程 ax² + bx + c = 0 的解。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "roots",
      "line_id": "roots-2",
      "filename": "roots-roots-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/roots-roots-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.17,
      "size": 34704,
      "text": "判别式 Δ = b² - 4ac 决定了根的情况。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "roots",
      "line_id": "roots-3",
      "filename": "roots-roots-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/roots-roots-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.74,
      "size": 43776,
      "text": "当 Δ 大于 0 时，有两个不相等的实根，抛物线与 x 轴有两个交点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "roots",
      "line_id": "roots-4",
      "filename": "roots-roots-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/roots-roots-4.mp3",
      "duration": 2.23,
      "size": 35712,
      "text": "当 Δ 等于 0 时，有一个重根，抛物线与 x 轴相切。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "roots",
      "line_id": "roots-5",
      "filename": "roots-roots-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/roots-roots-5.mp3",
      "duration": 2.34,
      "size": 37440,
      "text": "当 Δ 小于 0 时，没有实根，抛物线与 x 轴没有交点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "roots",
      "line_id": "roots-6",
      "filename": "roots-roots-6.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/roots-roots-6.mp3",
      "duration": 2.21,
      "size": 35424,
      "text": "图中绿色的点就是根，你可以用快速设置按钮查看不同情况。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "animation",
      "line_id": "animation-1",
      "filename": "animation-animation-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/animation-animation-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.4,
      "size": 38448,
      "text": "点击\"播放动画\"按钮，可以看到系数 a 从负 2 变化到正 2 的过程。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "animation",
      "line_id": "animation-2",
      "filename": "animation-animation-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/animation-animation-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.94,
      "size": 47088,
      "text": "观察抛物线如何从开口向下变成开口向上，中间经过 a = 0 时退化为直线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "animation",
      "line_id": "animation-3",
      "filename": "animation-animation-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/animation-animation-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.81,
      "size": 28944,
      "text": "这个动画帮助你理解系数 a 对抛物线形态的影响。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "examples",
      "line_id": "examples-1",
      "filename": "examples-examples-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/examples-examples-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.11,
      "size": 17712,
      "text": "让我们看几个典型的二次函数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "examples",
      "line_id": "examples-2",
      "filename": "examples-examples-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/examples-examples-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.48,
      "size": 39744,
      "text": "y = x² 是最简单的二次函数，顶点在原点，开口向上。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "examples",
      "line_id": "examples-3",
      "filename": "examples-examples-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/examples-examples-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.82,
      "size": 29088,
      "text": "y = -x² 开口向下，顶点也在原点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "examples",
      "line_id": "examples-4",
      "filename": "examples-examples-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/examples-examples-4.mp3",
      "duration": 3.12,
      "size": 49968,
      "text": "y = x² - 4 向下平移了 4 个单位，与 x 轴交于 x = 2 和 x = -2。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "examples",
      "line_id": "examples-5",
      "filename": "examples-examples-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/examples-examples-5.mp3",
      "duration": 3.13,
      "size": 50112,
      "text": "y = (x-1)² 向右平移了 1 个单位，顶点在 (1, 0)。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "application",
      "line_id": "application-1",
      "filename": "application-application-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/application-application-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.39,
      "size": 38304,
      "text": "二次函数在物理中描述抛体运动，比如投篮、发射炮弹的轨迹。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "application",
      "line_id": "application-2",
      "filename": "application-application-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/application-application-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.03,
      "size": 32544,
      "text": "在工程中，拱桥、抛物面天线都利用了抛物线的性质。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "application",
      "line_id": "application-3",
      "filename": "application-application-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/application-application-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.32,
      "size": 37152,
      "text": "在经济学中，利润函数常常是二次函数，顶点对应最大利润。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-1",
      "filename": "summary-summary-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/summary-summary-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.26,
      "size": 20160,
      "text": "让我们总结一下今天学到的内容。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-2",
      "filename": "summary-summary-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/summary-summary-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.19,
      "size": 50976,
      "text": "二次函数 y = ax² + bx + c 的图像是抛物线，a 决定开口方向和宽窄。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-3",
      "filename": "summary-summary-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/summary-summary-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.17,
      "size": 34704,
      "text": "顶点是抛物线的最值点，对称轴过顶点且垂直于 x 轴。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-4",
      "filename": "summary-summary-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/summary-summary-4.mp3",
      "duration": 3.75,
      "size": 60048,
      "text": "判别式 Δ 决定根的个数：Δ > 0 两根，Δ = 0 一根，Δ < 0 无实根。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadratic-function",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-5",
      "filename": "summary-summary-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadratic-function/xiaoxiao/summary-summary-5.mp3",
      "duration": 1.87,
      "size": 29952,
      "text": "希望通过这个实验，你对二次函数有了更深入的理解！"
    }
  ],
